OL,3,GNEWSADrought across England hits lamb
OL,4,Asales in Highlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarmers from England have not made
OL,7,Ftheir usual trip to the Scottish
OL,8,FHighlands for one of Europe's biggest
OL,9,Flamb sales after drought conditions hit
OL,10,Ftheir pastures, say auctioneers.
OL,12,FSheep sales at Lairg in Sutherland
OL,13,Finvolve the auction of thousands of
OL,14,Fanimals and usually draw buyers from
OL,15,Foutside of Scotland.
OL,17,FBut owners United Auctions said few
OL,18,FEnglish sheep producers made the
OL,19,Fjourney due to poor grazing as a result
OL,20,Fof heatwaves and a lack of rain.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
