OL,3,GNEWSADrought across England hits lamb
OL,4,Asales in Highlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FManaging director Donald Young told BBC
OL,7,FScotland: "There were not so many
OL,8,Fbuyers from south of the border because
OL,9,Fthere is no grass down there. Buyers
OL,10,Fwere predominately from Aberdeenshire
OL,11,Fand the rest of Scotland."
